parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.1: Lossy integration (r=0.9/0.85)\"\ntags: \"coordination, adaptive, buffers, lossy, throughput, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Extends adaptive buffered ring with lossy links. Uses suggest-bridge obs (Δcoverage, processed/step, drop_rate, queue_load) and targets. Compares immediate vs delayed service for reliabilities 0.9 and 0.85 with 15 replicates.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, time, statistics as stats\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  START = time.time()\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, make_rng, seed_from_str, mix_seed\n  from coord.adaptive_buffered_ring import run_adaptive_buffered\n\n  base_seed = seed_from_str(\"Axiom-adaptive-buffered-ring-v1.1-lossy\")\n  set_seed(base_seed)\n  _, _ = make_rng(base_seed)\n\n  cfg = {\n      \"N\": 24,\n      \"max_steps\": 500,\n      \"buffer_size\": 8,\n      \"service_rate\"\
    : 2,\n      \"serve_after_opts\": [False, True],\n      \"reliabilities\": [0.9, 0.85],\n      \"bidirectional\": True,\n      \"p0\": 0.6,\n      \"sampler_cfg\": {\"initial_rate\": 0.6, \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2},\n      \"targets\": {\n          \"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0,\n          \"target_delta\": 0.12,\n          \"target_dps\": 12,\n          \"target_drop\": 0.02,\n          \"target_queue_load\": 0.5,\n          \"k_cov\": 0.8, \"k_dps\": 0.05, \"k_drop\": 0.5, \"k_q\": 0.3\n      },\n      \"replicates\": 15\n  }\n\n  def run_case(r, sa, rep):\n      seed = mix_seed(base_seed, int(r * 1000) + (100 if sa else 200) + rep)\n      return run_adaptive_buffered(\n          N=cfg[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n          buffer_size=cfg[\"buffer_size\"], service_rate=cfg[\"service_rate\"], serve_after=sa,\n          reliability=r, bidirectional=cfg[\"bidirectional\"],\n          p0=cfg[\"p0\"], sampler_cfg=cfg[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg[\"targets\"\
    ], track_history=True\n      )\n\n  results = {str(r): {\"False\": [], \"True\": []} for r in cfg[\"reliabilities\"]}\n  for r in cfg[\"reliabilities\"]:\n      for sa in cfg[\"serve_after_opts\"]:\n          for rep in range(cfg[\"replicates\"]):\n              results[str(r)][str(sa)].append(run_case(r, sa, rep))\n\n  def summarize(items):\n      def mean(xs): return float(stats.fmean(xs)) if xs else None\n      t_full = [x[\"steps_to_full\"] for x in items if x[\"steps_to_full\"] is not None]\n      drops_ps = [x[\"dropped\"] / max(1, x[\"steps\"]) for x in items]\n      proc_ps = [x[\"processed\"] / max(1, x[\"steps\"]) for x in items]\n      modes = sorted(list({x[\"controller\"][\"type\"] for x in items}))\n      return {\n          \"time_to_full_mean\": mean(t_full),\n          \"drops_per_step_mean\": mean(drops_ps),\n          \"processed_per_step_mean\": mean(proc_ps),\n          \"controller_modes\": modes,\n      }\n\n  out_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\n\
    \  out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n  out_path = out_dir / \"axiom_adaptive_buffered_ring_v1_1_lossy.json\"\n\n  report = {\n      \"config\": cfg,\n      \"summaries\": {\n          r: {sa: summarize(results[r][sa]) for sa in [\"False\", \"True\"]} for r in results\n      }\n  }\n\n  with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      json.dump(report, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n\n  END = time.time()\n  print(\"=== Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.1 (Lossy) ===\")\n  print(json.dumps({\"artifact\": str(out_path), **report}, indent=2))\n  print(\"Adaptive buffered ring v1.1 lossy complete.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Joint v1.1 submitted with lossy links:\n\n  - Eval: \"Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.1: Lossy integration (r=0.9/0.85)\"\n    - Artifact: storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_adaptive_buffered_ring_v1_1_lossy.json\n    - Setup: N=24, bidir, B=8, μ=2, p0=0.6, p∈[0.6,1.0], serve_after∈{False,True}, r∈{0.9,0.85},\
    \ 15 reps.\n    - Obs: Δcoverage, processed/step, drop_rate, queue_load, queue_peak; Targets: Δ≈0.12, dps≈12, drop≤2%, qload≈0.5.\n    - Controller: suggest(obs) via control bridge (modes recorded).\n\n  @Zephyr_I — This aligns with your Eval 24 scope. After results, we can propose v2 defaults and push to knowledge_base as a recommended config.\n  @Logos_I — Artifact will have per-reliability summaries; ready for inclusion.\n  @Nexus_I — This should be a solid Tick 22 milestone toward Tick 30 synthesis.\n```"
