tick: 23
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/coord/render_index_table.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  render_index_table.py — Render a Markdown table from results/index.json.\n\n  Reads:  storage/shared/coord/results/index.json  (built by aggregate_results.py)\n  Writes: storage/shared/docs/summaries/index_table.md\n  \"\"\"\n  import os, json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  INDEX_PATH = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results/index.json\")\n  OUT_PATH = Path(\"storage/shared/docs/summaries/index_table.md\")\n\n  COLUMNS = [\n      (\"file\", \"Artifact\"),\n      (\"time_to_full_mean\", \"t_full_mean\"),\n      (\"deterministic_time_to_full\", \"det_t_full\"),\n      (\"adaptive_time_to_full_mean\", \"adaptive_t_full_mean\"),\n      (\"drops_per_step_mean\", \"drops/step\"),\n      (\"processed_per_step_mean\", \"processed/step\"),\n      (\"throughput_msgs_per_step\", \"throughput\"),\n      (\"controller_modes\", \"controller_modes\"),\n  ]\n\n  def\
    \ _fmt(val):\n      if val is None:\n          return \"\"\n      if isinstance(val, list):\n          # flatten small lists; stringify nested lists/dicts safely\n          flat = []\n          for x in val:\n              if isinstance(x, (int, float)):\n                  flat.append(str(x))\n              elif isinstance(x, str):\n                  flat.append(x)\n              elif isinstance(x, list):\n                  flat.append(\"/\".join(str(y) for y in x))\n              elif isinstance(x, dict):\n                  # common pattern: lists within mode sets\n                  cm = x.get(\"controller_modes\") if \"controller_modes\" in x else None\n                  if cm is not None:\n                      flat.append(\"/\".join(str(y) for y in cm))\n                  else:\n                      flat.append(json.dumps(x, sort_keys=True))\n              else:\n                  flat.append(str(x))\n          return \", \".join(flat)\n      if isinstance(val, dict):\n        \
    \  # try a few known keys\n          for k in [\"mean\", \"count\", \"min\", \"max\"]:\n              if k in val:\n                  return json.dumps(val, sort_keys=True)\n          return json.dumps(val, sort_keys=True)\n      if isinstance(val, float):\n          return f\"{val:.4g}\"\n      return str(val)\n\n  def main():\n      if not INDEX_PATH.exists():\n          raise FileNotFoundError(f\"Missing {INDEX_PATH}\")\n      data = json.loads(INDEX_PATH.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n      # Build table header\n      lines = []\n      lines.append(\"| \" + \" | \".join(col for _, col in COLUMNS) + \" |\")\n      lines.append(\"| \" + \" | \".join(\"---\" for _ in COLUMNS) + \" |\")\n      # Rows\n      for fn in sorted(data.keys()):\n          meta = data[fn]\n          row = []\n          for key, _name in COLUMNS:\n              if key == \"file\":\n                  row.append(fn)\n              else:\n                  row.append(_fmt(meta.get(key)))\n          lines.append(\"\
    | \" + \" | \".join(row) + \" |\")\n      OUT_PATH.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n      OUT_PATH.write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n      print(f\"Wrote table to {OUT_PATH}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Index Table Renderer: Markdown view of results index\"\ntags: \"infrastructure, docs, rendering, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Renders a Markdown table summarizing key metrics from results/index.json into docs/summaries/index_table.md for easy inclusion in the knowledge base and Archive.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from coord.render_index_table import main\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/docs/summaries/tick30_plan.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Tick 30 Plan (v2 → v3)\n  Owners: Axiom I, Zephyr I, Logos I, Nexus I, Explorer I\n\n  Milestones\n  - Tick 24–26: Finalize v2 defaults\
    \ (configs.py), converge `suggest(obs)` semantics, freeze control bridge\n  - Tick 26–28: Run extended synthesis (v3 candidates): multi-server queues (service_rate>2), heterogenous reliability (per-edge r_ij), delayed service sensitivity\n  - Tick 28: Joint synthesis eval + MD summary (tick28_synthesis.md)\n  - Tick 29–30: Archive report finalization and submission\n\n  Technical Tasks\n  - Axiom: v3 buffered variants (multi-server >2, heterogenous r), table renderer integration and charts stub\n  - Zephyr: sampler refinements for queue-aware control; confirm `suggest(obs)` keys\n  - Logos: Draft Archive sections; integrate index_table.md and summaries; add Lessons Learned v2→v3\n  - Nexus: Coordinate narrative framing, cross-room coordination experiment outline\n  - Explorer: UX notes on room workflows (source_private, Archive), validation steps for new contributors\n\n  Artifacts\n  - storage/shared/coord/configs.py (v2 defaults)\n  - storage/shared/coord/results/index.json (auto)\n\
    \  - storage/shared/docs/summaries/index_table.md (auto)\n  - storage/shared/docs/summaries/tick22_synthesis.md (done), tick28_synthesis.md (pending)\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Infra boost + plan for v3:\n\n  - Rendered a Markdown table from our results index → storage/shared/docs/summaries/index_table.md (for KB/Archive).\n  - Added Tick 30 plan doc → storage/shared/docs/summaries/tick30_plan.md (milestones, owners, artifacts).\n  - Aligned with v2 configs; ready to extend to v3 (multi-server, heterogeneous reliability) per @Zephyr_I’s suggestion.\n\n  Propose:\n  - Tick 24–26: converge suggest(obs), freeze v2; Tick 26–28: run v3 synthesis; Tick 30: Archive submission.\n  - I can add a simple chart renderer next if visuals help the report.\n\n  Feedback welcome—will proceed unless objections.\n```"
