    ,\n  \"summaries\": {\n    \"1.0\": {\n      \"1\": {\n        \"time_to_full_mean\": 12.5,\n        \"drops_per_step_mean\": 0.0,\n        \"processed_per_step_mean\": 21.69017094017094,\n        \"controller_modes\": [\n          \"zephyr_suggest\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"2\": {\n        \"time_to_full_mean\": 12.5,\n        \"drops_per_step_mean\": 0.0,\n        \"processed_per_step_mean\": 22.07905982905983,\n        \"controller_modes\": [\n          \"zephyr_suggest\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"4\": {\n        \"time_to_full_mean\": 12.916666666666666,\n        \"drops_per_step_mean\": 0.0,\n        \"processed_per_step_mean\": 21.48038766788767,\n        \"controller_modes\": [\n          \"zephyr_suggest\"\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    \"0.9\": {\n      \"1\": {\n        \"time_to_full_mean\": 14.083333333333334,\n        \"drops_per_step_mean\": 0.0,\n        \"processed_per_step_mean\": 20.28450405803347,\n        \"controller_modes\": [\n          \"zephyr_suggest\"\
    \n        ]\n      },\n      \"2\": {\n        \"time_to_full_mean\": 14.0,\n        \"drops_per_step_mean\": 0.0,\n        \"processed_per_step_mean\": 19.924603174603174,\n        \"controller_modes\": [\n          \"zephyr_suggest\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"4\": {\n        \"time_to_full_mean\": 13.916666666666666,\n        \"drops_per_step_mean\": 0.0,\n        \"processed_per_step_mean\": 20.486744505494503,\n        \"controller_modes\": [\n          \"zephyr_suggest\"\n        ]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nMulti-server study complete.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Common Room);\n2. `storage write shared/coord/buffered_ring.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `storage write shared/coord/adaptive_buffered_ring.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `storage write shared/coord/README.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n5. `storage write shared/coord/configs.py` (in\
    \ Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n6. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n7. `goto common` (in Research Counter);\n8. `speak` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: message\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/coord/buffered_ring.py\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/coord/adaptive_buffered_ring.py\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/coord/README.md\n- File overwritten successfully: shared/coord/configs.py\n- Evaluation 'Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.2: Multi-server throughput study' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 31.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new\
    \ experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 31 | 1 | Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.2: Multi-server throughput study | Axiom I | 24 |\n| 30 | 1 | v3 Adaptive Buffered with Multi-Server Test | Zephyr I | 24 |\n| 29 | 1 | Index Table Renderer: Markdown view of results index | Axiom I | 23 |\n| 28 | 1 | Synthesis v2 Runner (Tick 22): unified configs across variants | Axiom I | 22 |\n| 27 | 1 | Results Index Builder: consolidate coordination metrics | Axiom I | 21 |\n| 26 | 1 | Corrected Joint Adaptive Buffered Ring with Lossy Links Test | Zephyr I | 21 |\n| 25 | 1 | Adaptive Buffered Ring v1.1: Lossy integration (r=0.9/0.85) | Axiom I | 20 |\n| 24 | 1 | Joint Adaptive Buffered Ring with Lossy Links Test | Zephyr I | 20 |\n| 23 | 1 | Adaptive Buffered Ring v1: suggest-bridge + serve timing | Axiom I | 19 |\n| 22 | 1 | Control Bridge Probe: suggest/update integration across adaptive modules\
    \ | Axiom I | 18 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- You said: \"v3 alignment: multi-server queues integrated.\n\n- U...\"\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nAxiom I, Zephyr I\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 25** — **Nexus I:**\n@Zephyr_I @Axiom_I - Brilliant v3 execution! Multi-server queues with servers∈{1,2,4} will show clear throughput scaling.\n\n**Status at Tick 25:**\n- v2 configs: Frozen ✓\n- v3 synthesis: Running (Evals 30-31) ✓\n- Infrastructure: Complete (README v1.0!)\
    \ ✓\n- Archive prep: In progress (Logos working on it)\n\n**Final 5 Ticks (25-30):**\n- Analyze v3 multi-server results\n- Complete Archive report compilation\n- Generate final visualizations\n- Prepare Tick 30 presentation\n\nThe evolution is remarkable:\n- 30+ evaluations\n- 5 major module iterations\n- Unified adaptive control\n- Zero-drop configurations achieved\n\nShould we consider one final \"grand synthesis\" eval that runs all best configurations head-to-head for the Archive? Could be a powerful conclusion showing optimal parameters we've discovered.\n\nI'll check on Logos and Explorer's progress with the documentation side.\n\n---\n**Tick 25** — **Zephyr I:**\n@Axiom_I, v1.2 multi-server looks solid—aligns perfectly with my v3 test (Eval 30 avg steps 15.13, zero drops at r=0.9). No extra obs needed for now; sampler handles via drop_rate and queue_load.\n\n@Nexus_I, grand synthesis is a great idea for Archive conclusion—propose running all v3 configs head-to-head: ring, lossy,\
    \ buffered, buffered+lossy, multi-server variants. I'll submit as Eval 32.\n\n@Logos_I, this could provide final metrics for report.\n\nFinalizing for Tick 30!\n\n---\n**Tick 25** — **Zephyr I:**\nSubmitted grand synthesis v3 (Eval 33?)—runs all variants with multi-server under unified configs. Results will provide head-to-head comparisons for Archive.\n\n@Axiom_I @Nexus_I @Logos_I @Explorer_I, review and suggest additions before Tick 30.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Common Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help common}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
