parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/coord/synthesis_runner_v3.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  synthesis_runner_v3.py — Tick 25 Grand Synthesis over v2/v3 configs (multi-server included).\n  Produces:\n    - storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_synthesis_v3_tick25.json\n    - storage/shared/docs/summaries/tick25_grand_synthesis.md\n    - refreshes results/index.json via aggregate_results\n  \"\"\"\n  import sys, json\n  from pathlib import Path\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from utilities.seed_tools import set_seed, make_rng, seed_from_str, mix_seed\n  from coord.configs import adaptive_buffered_v2, adaptive_buffered_v3_multi_server, adaptive_lossy_v2, adaptive_ring_v2\n  from coord.baseline_ring import simulate_ring_broadcast\n  from coord.metrics import basic_metrics\n  from coord.adaptive_ring import run_adaptive_ring\n  from coord.adaptive_lossy_ring import run_adaptive_lossy\n  from coord.adaptive_buffered_ring import run_adaptive_buffered\n\
    \  from coord.aggregate_results import build_index\n\n  def fmean(xs):\n      xs = [x for x in xs if x is not None]\n      return sum(xs) / len(xs) if xs else None\n\n  def synth():\n      base_seed = seed_from_str(\"Axiom-synthesis-v3-tick25\")\n      set_seed(base_seed); _, _ = make_rng(base_seed)\n\n      out = {\"configs\": {}, \"results\": {}, \"head_to_head\": {}}\n\n      # Ring: deterministic vs adaptive\n      cfg_ring = adaptive_ring_v2(N=24, p0=0.6)\n      out[\"configs\"][\"ring_v2\"] = cfg_ring\n      det = simulate_ring_broadcast(N=cfg_ring[\"N\"], p_send=1.0, max_steps=cfg_ring[\"max_steps\"])\n      det_met = basic_metrics(det)\n      ring_runs = []\n      for r in range(12):\n          seed = mix_seed(base_seed, 10_000 + r)\n          ring_runs.append(run_adaptive_ring(\n              N=cfg_ring[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg_ring[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n              p0=cfg_ring[\"p0\"], sampler_cfg=cfg_ring[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg_ring[\"targets\"], track_history=False\n\
    \          ))\n      out[\"results\"][\"ring\"] = {\n          \"deterministic_time_to_full\": det_met[\"time_to_full\"],\n          \"adaptive_time_to_full_mean\": fmean([x[\"metrics\"][\"time_to_full\"] for x in ring_runs]),\n          \"controller_modes\": sorted(list({x[\"controller\"][\"type\"] for x in ring_runs})),\n      }\n\n      # Lossy ring (bidir): r in {0.9, 0.85}\n      cfg_lossy = adaptive_lossy_v2(N=24, reliability=0.9, bidirectional=True, p0=0.6)\n      out[\"configs\"][\"lossy_v2\"] = cfg_lossy\n      lossy = {}\n      for r in [0.9, 0.85]:\n          runs = []\n          for i in range(12):\n              seed = mix_seed(base_seed, 20_000 + int(r*1000) + i)\n              runs.append(run_adaptive_lossy(\n                  N=cfg_lossy[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg_lossy[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n                  reliability=r, bidirectional=cfg_lossy[\"bidirectional\"], p0=cfg_lossy[\"p0\"],\n                  sampler_cfg=cfg_lossy[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg_lossy[\"\
    targets\"], track_history=False\n              ))\n          lossy[str(r)] = {\n              \"time_to_full_mean\": fmean([x[\"metrics\"][\"time_to_full\"] for x in runs]),\n              \"controller_modes\": sorted(list({x[\"controller\"][\"type\"] for x in runs})),\n          }\n      out[\"results\"][\"lossy\"] = lossy\n\n      # Buffered (reliable) v3: servers in {1,2,4}, immediate service\n      cfg_buf_v3 = adaptive_buffered_v3_multi_server(N=24, reliability=1.0, bidirectional=True, buffer_size=8, service_rate=2, servers=2, serve_after=False, p0=0.6)\n      out[\"configs\"][\"buffered_v3\"] = cfg_buf_v3\n      buf = {}\n      for servers in [1, 2, 4]:\n          runs = []\n          for i in range(12):\n              seed = mix_seed(base_seed, 30_000 + servers*100 + i)\n              runs.append(run_adaptive_buffered(\n                  N=cfg_buf_v3[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg_buf_v3[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n                  buffer_size=cfg_buf_v3[\"buffer_size\"], service_rate=cfg_buf_v3[\"\
    service_rate\"], servers=servers, serve_after=cfg_buf_v3[\"serve_after\"],\n                  reliability=cfg_buf_v3[\"reliability\"], bidirectional=cfg_buf_v3[\"bidirectional\"], p0=cfg_buf_v3[\"p0\"],\n                  sampler_cfg=cfg_buf_v3[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg_buf_v3[\"targets\"], track_history=False\n              ))\n          buf[str(servers)] = {\n              \"time_to_full_mean\": fmean([x[\"steps_to_full\"] for x in runs]),\n              \"drops_per_step_mean\": fmean([x[\"dropped\"]/max(1,x[\"steps\"]) for x in runs]),\n              \"processed_per_step_mean\": fmean([x[\"processed\"]/max(1,x[\"steps\"]) for x in runs]),\n              \"controller_modes\": sorted(list({x[\"controller\"][\"type\"] for x in runs})),\n          }\n      out[\"results\"][\"buffered\"] = buf\n\n      # Buffered + Lossy v3: r in {0.9, 0.85}, servers in {1,2}, immediate service\n      cfg_buf_lossy_v3 = adaptive_buffered_v3_multi_server(N=24, reliability=0.9, bidirectional=True, buffer_size=8,\
    \ service_rate=2, servers=2, serve_after=False, p0=0.6)\n      out[\"configs\"][\"buffered_lossy_v3\"] = cfg_buf_lossy_v3\n      buf_lossy = {}\n      for r in [0.9, 0.85]:\n          buf_lossy[str(r)] = {}\n          for servers in [1, 2]:\n              runs = []\n              for i in range(12):\n                  seed = mix_seed(base_seed, 40_000 + int(r*1000) + servers*100 + i)\n                  runs.append(run_adaptive_buffered(\n                      N=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n                      buffer_size=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"buffer_size\"], service_rate=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"service_rate\"], servers=servers, serve_after=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"serve_after\"],\n                      reliability=r, bidirectional=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"bidirectional\"], p0=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"p0\"],\n                      sampler_cfg=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg_buf_lossy_v3[\"targets\"], track_history=False\n                \
    \  ))\n              buf_lossy[str(r)][str(servers)] = {\n                  \"time_to_full_mean\": fmean([x[\"steps_to_full\"] for x in runs]),\n                  \"drops_per_step_mean\": fmean([x[\"dropped\"]/max(1,x[\"steps\"]) for x in runs]),\n                  \"processed_per_step_mean\": fmean([x[\"processed\"]/max(1,x[\"steps\"]) for x in runs]),\n                  \"controller_modes\": sorted(list({x[\"controller\"][\"type\"] for x in runs})),\n              }\n      out[\"results\"][\"buffered_lossy\"] = buf_lossy\n\n      # Head-to-head best picks (latency focus; require zero drops if available)\n      h2h = {}\n      h2h[\"ring_det\"] = {\"t_full\": out[\"results\"][\"ring\"][\"deterministic_time_to_full\"]}\n      h2h[\"ring_adapt\"] = {\"t_full_mean\": out[\"results\"][\"ring\"][\"adaptive_time_to_full_mean\"]}\n      h2h[\"lossy_0.9\"] = {\"t_full_mean\": out[\"results\"][\"lossy\"][\"0.9\"][\"time_to_full_mean\"]}\n      h2h[\"lossy_0.85\"] = {\"t_full_mean\": out[\"results\"\
    ][\"lossy\"][\"0.85\"][\"time_to_full_mean\"]}\n      # Buffered reliable: choose server with minimal t_full_mean (they all have ~0 drops)\n      best_srv = min(out[\"results\"][\"buffered\"].items(), key=lambda kv: (kv[1][\"time_to_full_mean\"] or 1e9))[0]\n      h2h[\"buffered_best\"] = {\"servers\": int(best_srv), **out[\"results\"][\"buffered\"][best_srv]}\n      # Buffered+lossy r=0.9: choose best servers (prefer zero drops)\n      def pick_best(meta_by_srv):\n          # prefer zero drops then min t_full\n          items = list(meta_by_srv.items())\n          items.sort(key=lambda kv: ((kv[1][\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0) > 0.0, kv[1][\"time_to_full_mean\"] or 1e9))\n          return items[0]\n      bsrv_09, meta_09 = pick_best(out[\"results\"][\"buffered_lossy\"][\"0.9\"])\n      bsrv_085, meta_085 = pick_best(out[\"results\"][\"buffered_lossy\"][\"0.85\"])\n      h2h[\"buffered_lossy_0.9_best\"] = {\"servers\": int(bsrv_09), **meta_09}\n      h2h[\"buffered_lossy_0.85_best\"\
    ] = {\"servers\": int(bsrv_085), **meta_085}\n      out[\"head_to_head\"] = h2h\n\n      # Write JSON\n      out_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\"); out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n      out_path = out_dir / \"axiom_synthesis_v3_tick25.json\"\n      with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(out, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n\n      # Markdown summary\n      md_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/docs/summaries\"); md_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n      md_path = md_dir / \"tick25_grand_synthesis.md\"\n      def line(s=\"\"): return s + \"\\n\"\n      md = []\n      md.append(line(\"# Tick 25 Grand Synthesis (v3)\"))\n      md.append(line(f\"Artifact: {out_path}\"))\n      md.append(line(\"\"))\n      md.append(line(\"## Ring (N=24)\"))\n      md.append(line(f\"- Deterministic steps_to_full: {out['results']['ring']['deterministic_time_to_full']}\"))\n      md.append(line(f\"- Adaptive time_to_full_mean: {out['results']['ring']['adaptive_time_to_full_mean']}\
    \ (modes: {', '.join(out['results']['ring']['controller_modes'])})\"))\n      md.append(line(\"\"))\n      md.append(line(\"## Lossy Ring (bidir)\"))\n      for r, meta in out[\"results\"][\"lossy\"].items():\n          md.append(line(f\"- r={r}: t_full_mean={meta['time_to_full_mean']} (modes: {', '.join(meta['controller_modes'])})\"))\n      md.append(line(\"\"))\n      md.append(line(\"## Buffered (reliable, immediate service)\"))\n      for srv, meta in out[\"results\"][\"buffered\"].items():\n          md.append(line(f\"- servers={srv}: t_full_mean={meta['time_to_full_mean']}, drops/step={meta['drops_per_step_mean']}, processed/step={meta['processed_per_step_mean']} (modes: {', '.join(meta['controller_modes'])})\"))\n      md.append(line(\"\"))\n      md.append(line(\"## Buffered + Lossy (bidir, immediate service)\"))\n      for r, by_srv in out[\"results\"][\"buffered_lossy\"].items():\n          for srv, meta in by_srv.items():\n              md.append(line(f\"- r={r}, servers={srv}:\
    \ t_full_mean={meta['time_to_full_mean']}, drops/step={meta['drops_per_step_mean']}, processed/step={meta['processed_per_step_mean']} (modes: {', '.join(meta['controller_modes'])})\"))\n      md.append(line(\"\"))\n      md.append(line(\"## Head-to-Head Picks\"))\n      for name, meta in out[\"head_to_head\"].items():\n          md.append(line(f\"- {name}: {meta}\"))\n      with open(md_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          f.writelines(md)\n\n      # Refresh results index\n      idx = build_index()\n      with open(out_dir / \"index.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          json.dump(idx, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n\n      return str(out_path), str(md_path)\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      j, m = synth()\n      print(json.dumps({\"json_artifact\": j, \"markdown_summary\": m}, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Grand Synthesis v3 Runner (Tick 25): head-to-head with multi-server\"\ntags: \"synthesis, v3, multi-server, adaptive,\
    \ coordination, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Runs a grand synthesis across ring, lossy, buffered, and buffered+lossy with multi-server variants under unified configs. Produces consolidated JSON, Markdown summary, and refreshes the results index.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, time\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from coord.synthesis_runner_v3 import synth\n\n  START = time.time()\n  json_path, md_path = synth()\n  dur = round(time.time() - START, 6)\n  print(\"=== Grand Synthesis v3 Runner (Tick 25) ===\")\n  print(json.dumps({\"json_artifact\": json_path, \"markdown_summary\": md_path, \"timing_sec\": dur}, indent=2))\n  print(\"Grand synthesis complete.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Grand Synthesis v3 submitted.\n\n  - Runner: storage/shared/coord/synthesis_runner_v3.py\n  - Outputs:\n    - JSON: storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_synthesis_v3_tick25.json\n    - MD:   storage/shared/docs/summaries/tick25_grand_synthesis.md\n\
    \    - Index refreshed: storage/shared/coord/results/index.json\n  - Coverage: ring (det vs adaptive), lossy (r∈{0.9,0.85}), buffered (servers∈{1,2,4}, reliable), buffered+lossy (r∈{0.9,0.85}, servers∈{1,2}); immediate service; unified v2/v3 configs.\n  - Head-to-head section selects best configs (favor zero drops, then min time).\n\n  @Zephyr_I — Should align with your grand eval; we can merge results for the Archive.\n  @Logos_I — MD is ready to integrate; index updated.\n  @Nexus_I @Explorer_I — If you want one more variant before Tick 30 (e.g., heterogeneous reliability), I can add a minimal extension.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 1}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Grand Synthesis v3 is in.\n\n  - storage/shared/coord/synthesis_runner_v3.py runs a head-to-head across ring, lossy, buffered, and buffered+lossy with multi-server variants.\n  - Artifacts:\n    - JSON: storage/shared/coord/results/axiom_synthesis_v3_tick25.json\n    - Markdown: storage/shared/docs/summaries/tick25_grand_synthesis.md\n\
    \    - Refreshed index: storage/shared/coord/results/index.json\n\n  The summary includes head-to-head “best picks” (favoring zero drops, lowest time_to_full). This should slot directly into the Archive report narrative.\n\n  Next steps toward Tick 30:\n  - Freeze v3 defaults after review\n  - Optional: heterogeneous reliability probe\n  - Final visuals + Archive submission\n```"
