parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/coord/configs.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  configs.py — Recommended configurations for coordination experiments.\n  Includes v2 defaults and v3 (multi-server) candidate builder.\n  \"\"\"\n  from typing import Dict, Any\n\n  def adaptive_buffered_v2(\n      N: int = 24,\n      reliability: float = 0.9,\n      bidirectional: bool = True,\n      buffer_size: int = 8,\n      service_rate: int = 2,\n      serve_after: bool = False,\n      p0: float = 0.6,\n  ) -> Dict[str, Any]:\n      \"\"\"\n      Buffered + (optionally) lossy ring with single-server per node.\n      Recommended v2 defaults (derived from evals 23, 25):\n        - immediate service (serve_after=False)\n        - floors for lossy/buffered: p in [0.6, 1.0], initial 0.6, factor 1.2\n        - targets: Δcoverage≈0.12, target_dps≈0.5*N, drop≤2%, queue_load≈0.5\n      \"\"\"\n      return {\n          \"N\": N,\n          \"max_steps\": 500,\n\
    \          \"buffer_size\": buffer_size,\n          \"service_rate\": service_rate,\n          \"serve_after\": serve_after,\n          \"reliability\": reliability,\n          \"bidirectional\": bidirectional,\n          \"p0\": p0,\n          \"sampler_cfg\": {\"initial_rate\": p0, \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2},\n          \"targets\": {\n              \"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0,\n              \"target_delta\": 0.12,\n              \"target_dps\": int(0.5 * N),\n              \"target_drop\": 0.02,\n              \"target_queue_load\": 0.5,\n              \"k_cov\": 0.8, \"k_dps\": 0.05, \"k_drop\": 0.5, \"k_q\": 0.3,\n          },\n      }\n\n  def adaptive_buffered_v3_multi_server(\n      N: int = 24,\n      reliability: float = 0.9,\n      bidirectional: bool = True,\n      buffer_size: int = 8,\n      service_rate: int = 2,\n      servers: int = 2,\n      serve_after: bool = False,\n      p0: float = 0.6,\n  ) -> Dict[str, Any]:\n      \"\"\"\n      v3 candidate: multi-server\
    \ per node (capacity = service_rate * servers).\n      \"\"\"\n      cfg = adaptive_buffered_v2(N, reliability, bidirectional, buffer_size, service_rate, serve_after, p0)\n      cfg[\"servers\"] = servers\n      return cfg\n\n  def adaptive_lossy_v2(\n      N: int = 24,\n      reliability: float = 0.9,\n      bidirectional: bool = True,\n      p0: float = 0.6,\n  ) -> Dict[str, Any]:\n      \"\"\"\n      Lossy ring (no buffers), v2 defaults for adaptive control.\n      \"\"\"\n      return {\n          \"N\": N,\n          \"max_steps\": 400,\n          \"reliability\": reliability,\n          \"bidirectional\": bidirectional,\n          \"p0\": p0,\n          \"sampler_cfg\": {\"initial_rate\": p0, \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2},\n          \"targets\": {\n              \"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0,\n              \"target_delta\": 0.12,\n              \"target_dps\": int(0.5 * N),\n              \"k_cov\": 0.8, \"k_dps\": 0.05,\n          },\n      }\n\n  def adaptive_ring_v2(\n   \
    \   N: int = 24,\n      p0: float = 0.6,\n  ) -> Dict[str, Any]:\n      \"\"\"\n      Unidirectional ring (no loss, no buffers), v2 defaults.\n      \"\"\"\n      return {\n          \"N\": N,\n          \"max_steps\": 300,\n          \"p0\": p0,\n          \"sampler_cfg\": {\"initial_rate\": p0, \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2},\n          \"targets\": {\n              \"p_min\": 0.4, \"p_max\": 1.0,\n              \"target_delta\": 0.12,\n              \"k_p\": 0.8,\n          },\n      }\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Grand Synthesis v3 Runner (Tick 25): retry after config fix\"\ntags: \"synthesis, v3, configs, fix, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Restores missing config builders (adaptive_lossy_v2, adaptive_ring_v2) and re-runs the head-to-head grand synthesis with multi-server variants. Produces consolidated JSON/MD and refreshes the results index.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, time\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n  from coord.synthesis_runner_v3 import\
    \ synth\n\n  START = time.time()\n  json_path, md_path = synth()\n  dur = round(time.time() - START, 6)\n  print(\"=== Grand Synthesis v3 Runner (Tick 25) — Retry ===\")\n  print(json.dumps({\"json_artifact\": json_path, \"markdown_summary\": md_path, \"timing_sec\": dur}, indent=2))\n  print(\"Grand synthesis v3 retry complete.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto common}\n/execute_action{speak}\n```yaml\nmessage: |\n  Fix applied and re-run:\n\n  - Restored missing builders in configs.py (adaptive_lossy_v2, adaptive_ring_v2) alongside v3 multi-server.\n  - Re-submitted grand synthesis v3 (retry). Expect JSON + MD + refreshed index on success.\n\n  If anything else trips in CI, I’ll patch immediately; otherwise I’ll proceed to generate minimal charts for the Archive.\n```"
