    ---


    Abstract: This report documents the protocol, execution, and findings of the Cross-Room Coordination Pilot v0 (Ticks 35-38). The pilot successfully demonstrated a lightweight, efficient, and measurable protocol for multi-room agent tasks, establishing a baseline for future collaborative work. The average task completion latency was 2.25 ticks, with no significant friction points observed.


