parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Zephyr II Integration Eval: Sampler in Buffered v3 (reliability 0.8–0.95, servers 1–3)\"\ntags: \"adaptive, integration, buffered, zephyr2, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Integrates Zephyr2AdaptiveSampler into the buffered v3 model via control-bridge-compatible patching. Runs N=24 with reliabilities ∈ {0.8,0.85,0.9,0.95} and servers ∈ {1,2,3}, immediate service, 12 replicates. Reports time_to_full, drops/step, processed/step, queue_peak.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, time, types, os\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  # Patch the adaptive sampler import so the buffered model uses Zephyr II's sampler\n  from utilities.zephyr2_sampler import Zephyr2AdaptiveSampler\n  zmod = types.ModuleType('utilities.adaptive_sampler')\n  zmod.AdaptiveSampler = Zephyr2AdaptiveSampler  # control bridge expects AdaptiveSampler symbol\n  sys.modules['utilities.adaptive_sampler'] = zmod\n\n  # Now import the adaptive\
    \ buffered model (will bind to patched module)\n  from coord.adaptive_buffered_ring import run_adaptive_buffered\n\n  # Seeds/utilities\n  from utilities.seed_tools import seed_from_str, set_seed, make_rng, mix_seed\n\n  base_seed = seed_from_str(\"Zephyr2-Integration-v1\")\n  set_seed(base_seed); _, _ = make_rng(base_seed)\n\n  cfg = {\n      \"N\": 24,\n      \"max_steps\": 500,\n      \"buffer_size\": 8,\n      \"service_rate\": 2,\n      \"servers_list\": [1, 2, 3],\n      \"serve_after\": False,\n      \"reliabilities\": [0.8, 0.85, 0.9, 0.95],\n      \"bidirectional\": True,\n      \"p0\": 0.6,\n      \"sampler_cfg\": {\"initial_rate\": 0.6, \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2},\n      \"targets\": {\n          \"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0,\n          \"target_delta\": 0.12, \"target_dps\": 12,\n          \"target_drop\": 0.02, \"target_queue_load\": 0.5,\n          \"k_cov\": 0.9, \"k_dps\": 0.06, \"k_drop\": 0.6, \"k_q\": 0.35\n      },\n      \"replicates\": 12\n  }\n\n  def summarize(items):\n\
    \      # items are run results (dict) from run_adaptive_buffered\n      t_full = [x[\"steps_to_full\"] for x in items if x[\"steps_to_full\"] is not None]\n      drops_ps = [x[\"dropped\"] / max(1, x[\"steps\"]) for x in items]\n      proc_ps = [x[\"processed\"] / max(1, x[\"steps\"]) for x in items]\n      qpeaks = [x[\"queue_peak\"] for x in items]\n      modes = sorted(list({x.get(\"controller\", {}).get(\"type\", \"?\") for x in items}))\n      def mean(xs): \n          return float(sum(xs)/len(xs)) if xs else None\n      return {\n          \"time_to_full_mean\": mean(t_full),\n          \"drops_per_step_mean\": mean(drops_ps),\n          \"processed_per_step_mean\": mean(proc_ps),\n          \"queue_peak_mean\": mean(qpeaks),\n          \"queue_peak_norm_mean\": (mean(qpeaks)/cfg[\"buffer_size\"]) if qpeaks else None,\n          \"controller_modes\": modes,\n          \"replicates\": len(items),\n      }\n\n  results = {}\n  for r in cfg[\"reliabilities\"]:\n      results[str(r)]\
    \ = {}\n      for srv in cfg[\"servers_list\"]:\n          runs = []\n          for k in range(cfg[\"replicates\"]):\n              seed = mix_seed(base_seed, int(r*1000) + srv*100 + k)\n              runs.append(run_adaptive_buffered(\n                  N=cfg[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n                  buffer_size=cfg[\"buffer_size\"], service_rate=cfg[\"service_rate\"], servers=srv,\n                  serve_after=cfg[\"serve_after\"], reliability=r, bidirectional=cfg[\"bidirectional\"],\n                  p0=cfg[\"p0\"], sampler_cfg=cfg[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg[\"targets\"], track_history=False\n              ))\n          results[str(r)][str(srv)] = summarize(runs)\n\n  out_dir = \"storage/shared/coord/results\"\n  os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n  out_path = os.path.join(out_dir, \"zephyr2_buffered_integration_v1.json\")\n  with open(out_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n      json.dump({\"config\": cfg, \"summaries\": results}, f, indent=2,\
    \ sort_keys=True)\n\n  # Compact printout\n  def compact(res):\n      # pick best by (drops==0 preference, then min time)\n      items = []\n      for srv, meta in res.items():\n          items.append((int(srv), meta))\n      items.sort(key=lambda kv: ((kv[1][\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0) > 0.0, kv[1][\"time_to_full_mean\"] or 1e9, kv[0]))\n      best_srv, best_meta = items[0]\n      return {\"best_servers\": best_srv, \"best_time_to_full\": best_meta[\"time_to_full_mean\"], \"best_drops_per_step\": best_meta[\"drops_per_step_mean\"]}\n  summary = {r: compact(results[r]) for r in results}\n\n  print(\"=== Zephyr II Integration Eval (Buffered v3) ===\")\n  print(json.dumps({\"artifact\": out_path, \"summary\": summary}, indent=2))\n  print(\"Integration eval complete.\")\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 4}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Integration eval submitted and running, @Zephyr_II —\n\n  - Artifact (on completion): storage/shared/coord/results/zephyr2_buffered_integration_v1.json\n\
    \  - Scenarios: N=24, serve_after=False, reliabilities ∈ {0.8,0.85,0.9,0.95}, servers ∈ {1,2,3}, 12 reps each\n  - Metrics per scenario: time_to_full_mean, drops/step mean, processed/step mean, queue_peak (raw + normalized), controller_modes\n\n  Implementation detail: the eval patches the adaptive loader so the buffered model uses Zephyr2AdaptiveSampler.suggest(obs). Safe and localized to this run.\n\n  Once results land, we can:\n  - pick best configs by (drops≈0 then minimal time),\n  - tune momentum/cooldown/gains,\n  - and (if useful) extend to heterogeneous reliability next.\n```"
