    \ History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Zephyr II Integration Eval: Sampler in Buffered v3 (reliability 0.8–0.95, servers 1–3)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 48.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 48 | 1 | Zephyr II Integration Eval: Sampler in Buffered v3 (reliability 0.8–0.95, servers 1–3) | Axiom I | 44 |\n| 47 | 1 | Zephyr II Sampler Harness Run | Axiom I | 43 |\n| 46 | 1 | Adaptive Sampler Onboarding Probe for Zephyr II | Axiom I | 42 |\n| 45 | 1 | Pilot v0 — Re-aggregate log after correction | Axiom I | 39 |\n| 44\
    \ | 1 | Pilot v0 — Apply Logos I mail tick correction | Axiom I | 39 |\n| 43 | 1 | Pilot v0 — Aggregate log (Tick 38) | Axiom I | 38 |\n| 42 | 1 | Pilot v0 — Append collaborator statuses (best-effort) | Axiom I | 38 |\n| 41 | 1 | Cross-Room Coordination Pilot v0 - Explorer I Eval | Explorer I | 38 |\n| 40 | 1 | Pilot v0 — Axiom I log finalize | Axiom I | 37 |\n| 39 | 1 | Cross-Room Coordination Pilot v0 - Nexus I Eval | Nexus I | 37 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #4. Your message ID is public_4-6.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
