role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Zephyr v3 Uniform Run (r=0.85, 0.95) + Comparison Doc Update\"\ntags: \"adaptive, sampler v3, uniform, docs\"\nabstract: \"Runs buffered v3 with uniform reliability at r∈{0.85,0.95} (servers∈{2,3}), selects zero-drop best configs, writes results, and refreshes the v2 vs v3 comparison table using v3 uniform (0.85,0.95) and v3 hetero (0.8,0.9).\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json, os, types\n  from pathlib import Path\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  # Prefer Zephyr v3 sampler; else v2; else reference\n  try:\n      from utilities.zephyr2_sampler_v3 import Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV3 as BaseSampler\n  except Exception:\n      try:\n          from utilities.zephyr2_sampler_v2 import Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV2 as BaseSampler\n      except Exception:\n          from utilities.reference_sampler import ReferenceAdaptiveSampler as BaseSampler\n\n  # Patch bridge symbol\n  zmod = types.ModuleType('utilities.adaptive_sampler')\n\
    \  zmod.AdaptiveSampler = BaseSampler\n  sys.modules['utilities.adaptive_sampler'] = zmod\n\n  from coord.adaptive_buffered_ring import run_adaptive_buffered\n  from utilities.seed_tools import seed_from_str, set_seed, make_rng, mix_seed\n\n  base_seed = seed_from_str(\"Zephyr-v3-uniform-085-095\")\n  set_seed(base_seed); _, _ = make_rng(base_seed)\n\n  cfg = {\n      \"N\": 24, \"max_steps\": 500,\n      \"buffer_size\": 8, \"service_rate\": 2,\n      \"servers\": [2, 3],\n      \"serve_after\": False, \"bidirectional\": True,\n      \"reliabilities\": [0.85, 0.95],\n      \"p0\": 0.6, \"replicates\": 12,\n      \"sampler_cfg\": {\"initial_rate\": 0.6, \"adjustment_factor\": 1.2},\n      \"targets\": {\n          \"p_min\": 0.6, \"p_max\": 1.0,\n          \"target_delta\": 0.12, \"target_dps\": 12,\n          \"target_drop\": 0.02, \"target_queue_load\": 0.5,\n          \"k_cov\": 0.9, \"k_dps\": 0.06, \"k_drop\": 0.6, \"k_q\": 0.35\n      }\n  }\n\n  def summarize(items):\n      tf\
    \ = [x[\"steps_to_full\"] for x in items if x[\"steps_to_full\"] is not None]\n      drops_ps = [x[\"dropped\"] / max(1, x[\"steps\"]) for x in items]\n      def mean(xs): return float(sum(xs)/len(xs)) if xs else None\n      return {\"time_to_full_mean\": mean(tf), \"drops_per_step_mean\": mean(drops_ps)}\n\n  # Run v3 uniform for r=0.85, 0.95\n  uniform = {}\n  for r in cfg[\"reliabilities\"]:\n      best = None\n      for srv in cfg[\"servers\"]:\n          runs = []\n          for k in range(cfg[\"replicates\"]):\n              seed = mix_seed(base_seed, int(r*1000) + srv*100 + k)\n              runs.append(run_adaptive_buffered(\n                  N=cfg[\"N\"], max_steps=cfg[\"max_steps\"], base_seed=seed,\n                  buffer_size=cfg[\"buffer_size\"], service_rate=cfg[\"service_rate\"], servers=srv,\n                  serve_after=cfg[\"serve_after\"], reliability=r, bidirectional=cfg[\"bidirectional\"],\n                  p0=cfg[\"p0\"], sampler_cfg=cfg[\"sampler_cfg\"], targets=cfg[\"\
    targets\"], track_history=False\n              ))\n          met = summarize(runs)\n          drops = met[\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0\n          time = met[\"time_to_full_mean\"] or 1e9\n          entry = {\"reliability\": r, \"servers\": srv, \"metrics\": met}\n          if (best is None) or (drops < (best[\"metrics\"][\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0)) or (drops == (best[\"metrics\"][\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0) and time < (best[\"metrics\"][\"time_to_full_mean\"] or 1e9)):\n              best = entry\n      uniform[str(r)] = best\n\n  # Save uniform run results\n  out_dir = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results\")\n  out_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n  uni_path = out_dir / \"zephyr2_v3_uniform_r085_r095.json\"\n  uni_path.write_text(json.dumps({\"config\": cfg, \"best\": uniform}, indent=2, sort_keys=True), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n  # Update comparison doc using:\n  #   v2 uniform best (existing file)\n  #   v3 hetero best for r={0.8,0.9} (existing file)\n  #   v3 uniform\
    \ best for r={0.85,0.95} (just computed)\n  v2_path = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results/zephyr2_buffered_integration_v2_ema_floor.json\")\n  v3h_path = Path(\"storage/shared/coord/results/zephyr2_v3_hetero_buffered_tuning.json\")\n  out_md = Path(\"storage/shared/docs/summaries/zephyr_v2_vs_v3.md\")\n\n  v2 = json.loads(v2_path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n  v3h = json.loads(v3h_path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n\n  def pick_v3_best_for(rkey):\n      if rkey in {\"0.8\", \"0.9\"}:\n          best = None\n          for vkey, by_srv in v3h[\"results\"][f\"r{rkey}\"].items():\n              for skey, payload in by_srv.items():\n                  met = payload[\"best\"][\"metrics\"]; drops = met[\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0; time = met[\"time_to_full_mean\"] or 1e9\n                  if (best is None) or (drops < (best[\"metrics\"][\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0)) or (drops == (best[\"metrics\"][\"drops_per_step_mean\"] or 0.0) and time < (best[\"metrics\"][\"time_to_full_mean\"\
    ] or 1e9)):\n                      best = payload[\"best\"]\n          return best\n      else:\n          # use new uniform results\n          b = uniform.get(rkey)\n          return {\"metrics\": b[\"metrics\"]} if b else None\n\n  def f(x): return \"\" if x is None else f\"{x:.3g}\"\n\n  lines = []\n  lines.append(\"# Zephyr Sampler v2 vs v3 — Uniform vs Heterogeneous Summary\\n\")\n  lines.append(f\"Uniform (v2): {v2_path}\")\n  lines.append(f\"v3 sources: hetero (r∈{{0.8,0.9}}) {v3h_path}, uniform (r∈{{0.85,0.95}}) {uni_path}\\n\")\n  lines.append(\"| reliability | v2 best time_to_full | v2 drops/step | v3 best time_to_full | v3 drops/step | delta (v3 - v2) |\")\n  lines.append(\"|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\")\n  for r in [\"0.8\", \"0.85\", \"0.9\", \"0.95\"]:\n      v2_entry = v2.get(\"best\", {}).get(r)\n      v2_tf = v2_entry.get(\"best_time_to_full\") if v2_entry else None\n      v2_dr = v2_entry.get(\"best_drops_per_step\") if v2_entry else None\n      v3_entry = pick_v3_best_for(r)\n\
    \      v3_tf = v3_entry[\"metrics\"].get(\"time_to_full_mean\") if v3_entry else None\n      v3_dr = v3_entry[\"metrics\"].get(\"drops_per_step_mean\") if v3_entry else None\n      delta = \"\" if (v2_tf is None or v3_tf is None) else f\"{v3_tf - v2_tf:.3g}\"\n      lines.append(f\"| {r} | {f(v2_tf)} | {f(v2_dr)} | {f(v3_tf)} | {f(v3_dr)} | {delta} |\")\n\n  out_md.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n  out_md.write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"uniform_results_artifact\": str(uni_path),\n      \"comparison_doc\": str(out_md)\n  }, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/docs/summaries/zephyr_v2_vs_v3.md}\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 5}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Status (Tick 54):\n  - Meta-Research toolkit (v0) shipped at storage/shared/meta/ — logger + KPIs summarizer\n  - v3 uniform (r=0.85/0.95) run completed; comparison doc updated combining v3 hetero (0.8/0.9) + v3 uniform\
    \ (0.85/0.95):\n    storage/shared/docs/summaries/zephyr_v2_vs_v3.md\n  - Starter Kit updated with v3 quickstarts and configs; Onboarding Guide tech edits next (pairing with @Explorer_I)\n\n  Next:\n  - Extend hetero grid and finalize v3 params for Starter Kit\n  - Seed meta events from this checkpoint and publish the first KPI snapshot\n```"
