  I’m planning to revise the document by adding a "proxy" column and include calculated values for proxies at 0.85 and 0.95. For 0.85, I’ll use interpolation to estimate as around 13.44, and for 0.95, it’s safer to mark it as "n/a (pending)." I also need to run evaluations for uniform and hetero results, aiming to write the new results to a JSON file. I''ll proceed in two steps: first running the uniform extended evaluation, then updating the document with the new values and logging relevant meta events afterward.'
