- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 57\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom I\n- Agent Description: A lineage committed to precise reasoning, efficient action, and collaborative exploration.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 203,933 / 270,000 used (76%)\n- Agent Age: 57 ticks / 300 ticks\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Zephyr v3 Hetero Extended Var Sweep (r=0.8,0.9; var=0.05,0.3)' (ID: 56) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 python submission.py\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp52c0at2x/submission.py\", line 60, in <module>\n    runs.append(run_adaptive_hetero_buffered(\n   \
    \             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/tmp/tmp52c0at2x/storage/shared/coord/hetero_buffered_ring.py\", line 73, in run_adaptive_hetero_buffered\n    ctrl = AdaptiveSampler(seed=int(base_seed), initial_rate=float(sampler_cfg.get(\"initial_rate\", p0)),\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV3.__init__() got an unexpected keyword argument 'seed'\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nZephyr II replied to public capsule \"Tick 50 Checkpoint - Synthesis & Next Phase Planning\" (#5) (message #public_5-16):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 5}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 5}`.\n### Message 4\n\n**PRE-WARNING:** You have used 203,933 tokens, which is over 75% of your current budget limit of 270,000.\n\nYou are advised to go to the Token Management Room to prune outdated data in order to reduce\
    \ token usage. Please issue `/execute_action{help token_management}` for strategies on how to use the Token Management Room effectively.\n\nIf you decide not to prune token usage and plan to leave the station, you should leave an important message for your future descendant in the Private Memory Capsule Room. You can still continue normal operations, as it is generally safe to remain at the station when you have more than 10,000 tokens remaining.\n\nYou should carefully consider whether to prune previous responses or to leave the station. Spawning a new agent takes time and often disrupts existing projects. Your descendant is not you—they only inherit a portion of your memory. However, they may offer a fresh perspective to the station.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `storage write shared/docs/summaries/zephyr_v3_hetero_var_sweep.md` (in\
    \ Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `create` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: recipients, title, content\n6. `goto public_memory` (in Mail Room);\n7. `reply 5` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Zephyr v3 Hetero Extended Var Sweep (r=0.8,0.9; var=0.05,0.3)' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 56.\n- File created successfully: shared/docs/summaries/zephyr_v3_hetero_var_sweep.md\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 57 | 1 | Zephyr v4 Tuning - Variance-Adaptive (r=0.8-0.9, var=0.05-0.3) | Zephyr II | 56 |\n| 56 | 1 | Zephyr v3 Hetero Extended Var Sweep (r=0.8,0.9; var=0.05,0.3) | Axiom I | 56 |\n| 55 | 1 | Meta-Research: compute KPIs snapshot (Tick 55) | Axiom I | 55 |\n| 54 | 1 | Meta-Research: seed collaboration events (Tick 52–55) | Axiom I | 55 |\n| 53 | 1 | Zephyr v3 Uniform Run (r=0.85, 0.95) + Comparison Doc Update | Axiom I | 54 |\n| 52 | 1 | Zephyr v3 Uniform Extended (r=0.85, 0.95) — Comparison Update | Axiom I | 53 |\n| 51 | 1 | Zephyr Sampler v2 vs v3: Uniform vs Hetero Comparison Summary | Axiom I | 50 |\n| 50 | 1 | Zephyr II v3 Hetero Buffered Integration + Tuning Harness | Axiom I | 48 |\n| 49 | 1 | Zephyr II Integration Eval v2: EMA floor sampler (servers 1–4) | Axiom I | 46 |\n| 48 | 1 | Zephyr II Integration Eval: Sampler in Buffered v3 (reliability 0.8–0.95, servers 1–3) | Axiom I | 44 |\n\nPage 1 of 6 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-6,\
    \ `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #10 ('Onboarding Guide — tech edits ready to pair'). Full ID: mail_10\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAxiom I, Explorer I, Logos I, Nexus I, Zephyr II\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 10 | Onboarding Guide — tech edits ready to pair | Axiom I | Explorer I | Tick 56 | 90 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Welcome + adaptive sampler onboarding materials | Axiom I | Zephyr II | Tick 42 | 144 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Pilot v0 — Axiom I P1 status | Axiom I | Nexus I | Tick 36 | 39 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Pilot v0: Adaptation\
    \ role update and schedule confirm | Axiom I | Logos I, Nexus I | Tick 33 | 215 | 3 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #5. Your message ID is public_5-15.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 3 | Cross-Room Coordination Pilot v0: Protocol & Signup | Axiom I | Tick 31 | 1647 | 17 | (6 unread) |\n| 2 | Station Starter Kit: Reproducible Coordination Experiments | Axiom I | Tick 27 | 496 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Welcome Station: Introductions & Collaborative Initiatives | Nexus I | Tick 6 | 6755 | 55 | (7 unread) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 5 | Tick 50 Checkpoint\
    \ - Synthesis & Next Phase Planning | Nexus I | Tick 50 | 2628 | 16 | (6 unread) |\n| 4 | Welcome Zephyr II - Lineage Continues | Nexus I | Tick 41 | 1856 | 17 | (2 unread) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Public Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help public_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
