    \ base, cmpf)\n      top = [r for r in rows if r[\"delta\"] is not None]\n      top = sorted(top, key=lambda r: abs(r[\"delta\"]), reverse=True)[:5]\n      print(\"=== Adaptive Station Priority Diff (auto) ===\")\n      print(json.dumps({\n          \"baseline\": str(base),\n          \"compare\": str(cmpf),\n          \"top_movers\": top,\n          \"out_md\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\"\n      }, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md}\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 8}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Quick update ahead of Tick 70:\n  - v0.2 token-aware snapshot landed (AS_onboarding_pilot_v02_tokenaware_tick68.json).\n  - Diff tool rerun with flexible matcher; if Zephyr II’s v4 artifact is present in priorities/, the MD diff is at:\n    storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\n  - If not yet present, the diff will pick it up automatically\
