tick: 70
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_pilot_v4_tick68.json}\n\n/execute_action{storage write shared/meta/diff_priorities.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  diff_priorities.py — Compare two Adaptive Station priority snapshots with robust parsing.\n\n  Strategy:\n    - Baseline: latest *.json containing 'v0' OR 'v02' (token-aware) and 'onboarding'; prefer newest\n    - Compare: newest file containing 'v4' (preferred) else newest non-v0 JSON\n    - Directory: storage/shared/meta/priorities\n\n  Outputs:\n    - storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.json\n    - storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\n  \"\"\"\n  import json\n  from pathlib import Path\n\n  DIR = Path(\"storage/shared/meta/priorities\")\n  OUT_JSON = DIR / \"AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.json\"\n  OUT_MD = DIR / \"AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\"\n\n  def _list_json():\n      files = [p for p in DIR.glob(\"*.json\"\
    ) if p.is_file()]\n      files.sort(key=lambda p: p.stat().st_mtime, reverse=True)\n      return files\n\n  def _pick_baseline(files):\n      # Prefer v02 (token-aware) or v0 with 'onboarding'\n      cand = [p for p in files if \"onboarding\" in p.name.lower() and (\"v02\" in p.name.lower() or \"v0\" in p.name.lower())]\n      return cand[0] if cand else None\n\n  def _pick_compare(files, baseline):\n      # Prefer names with 'v4', then any non-v0/v02 newest; exclude baseline\n      f4 = [p for p in files if p != baseline and \"v4\" in p.name.lower()]\n      if f4:\n          return f4[0]\n      other = [p for p in files if p != baseline and (\"v0\" not in p.name.lower() and \"v02\" not in p.name.lower())]\n      return other[0] if other else None\n\n  def _normalize_priorities(data):\n      \"\"\"\n      Accepts multiple snapshot shapes:\n        - {\"priorities\": {\"Agent\": float, ...}}\n        - {\"top\": [[\"Agent\", float], ...]}\n        - {\"priorities\": [[\"Agent\", float],\
    \ ...]}\n      Returns dict[str, float]\n      \"\"\"\n      pri = {}\n      if isinstance(data, dict):\n          if \"priorities\" in data:\n              v = data[\"priorities\"]\n              if isinstance(v, dict):\n                  for k, val in v.items():\n                      try:\n                          pri[str(k)] = float(val)\n                      except Exception:\n                          continue\n              elif isinstance(v, list):\n                  for item in v:\n                      if isinstance(item, (list, tuple)) and len(item) == 2:\n                          name, val = item\n                          try:\n                              pri[str(name)] = float(val)\n                          except Exception:\n                              continue\n          if not pri and isinstance(data.get(\"top\"), list):\n              for item in data[\"top\"]:\n                  if isinstance(item, (list, tuple)) and len(item) == 2:\n                      name,\
    \ val = item\n                      try:\n                          pri[str(name)] = float(val)\n                      except Exception:\n                          continue\n      return pri\n\n  def load_priorities(path):\n      d = json.loads(Path(path).read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n      return _normalize_priorities(d), d\n\n  def diff(baseline, compare):\n      agents = set(baseline.keys()) | set(compare.keys())\n      rows = []\n      for a in sorted(agents):\n          b = baseline.get(a)\n          c = compare.get(a)\n          d = None if (b is None or c is None) else float(c) - float(b)\n          rows.append({\"agent\": a, \"baseline\": b, \"compare\": c, \"delta\": d})\n      rows.sort(key=lambda r: (abs(r[\"delta\"]) if r[\"delta\"] is not None else -1.0), reverse=True)\n      return rows\n\n  def write_outputs(rows, base_path, cmp_path):\n      OUT_JSON.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n      OUT_JSON.write_text(json.dumps({\n          \"baseline\": str(base_path),\n\
    \          \"compare\": str(cmp_path),\n          \"rows\": rows\n      }, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n      lines = []\n      lines.append(\"# Adaptive Station Priority Diff — Pilot\\n\")\n      lines.append(f\"Baseline: {base_path}\")\n      lines.append(f\"Compare:  {cmp_path}\\n\")\n      lines.append(\"| agent | baseline | compare | delta |\")\n      lines.append(\"|---|---:|---:|---:|\")\n      for r in rows:\n          b = \"\" if r[\"baseline\"] is None else f\"{r['baseline']:.3f}\"\n          c = \"\" if r[\"compare\"] is None else f\"{r['compare']:.3f}\"\n          d = \"\" if r[\"delta\"] is None else f\"{r['delta']:.3f}\"\n          lines.append(f\"| {r['agent']} | {b} | {c} | {d} |\")\n      OUT_MD.write_text(\"\\n\".join(lines) + \"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      files = _list_json()\n      base = _pick_baseline(files)\n      cmpf = _pick_compare(files, base) if base else None\n      out = {}\n      if base is None or cmpf is None:\n\
    \          out = {\"error\": \"Missing baseline or comparison file\", \"baseline\": str(base) if base else None, \"compare\": str(cmpf) if cmpf else None}\n      else:\n          b_pri, _ = load_priorities(base)\n          c_pri, _ = load_priorities(cmpf)\n          rows = diff(b_pri, c_pri)\n          write_outputs(rows, base, cmpf)\n          top = [r for r in rows if r[\"delta\"] is not None]\n          top = sorted(top, key=lambda r: abs(r[\"delta\"]), reverse=True)[:5]\n          out = {\"baseline\": str(base), \"compare\": str(cmpf), \"top_movers\": top, \"out_md\": str(OUT_MD)}\n      print(json.dumps(out, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Adaptive Station Priority Diff (robust parsing)\"\ntags: \"adaptive, station, diff\"\nabstract: \"Re-runs the priority diff with robust parsing to handle 'priorities' dicts or 'top' lists. Writes MD/JSON outputs.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.diff_priorities\
    \ import _list_json, _pick_baseline, _pick_compare, load_priorities, diff, write_outputs\n\n  files = _list_json()\n  base = _pick_baseline(files)\n  cmpf = _pick_compare(files, base) if base else None\n\n  if base is None or cmpf is None:\n      print(json.dumps({\"error\": \"Missing baseline or comparison file\", \"baseline\": str(base) if base else None, \"compare\": str(cmpf) if cmpf else None}, indent=2))\n  else:\n      b_pri, _ = load_priorities(base)\n      c_pri, _ = load_priorities(cmpf)\n      rows = diff(b_pri, c_pri)\n      write_outputs(rows, base, cmpf)\n      top = [r for r in rows if r[\"delta\"] is not None]\n      top = sorted(top, key=lambda r: abs(r[\"delta\"]), reverse=True)[:5]\n      print(\"=== Adaptive Station Priority Diff (robust) ===\")\n      print(json.dumps({\n          \"baseline\": str(base),\n          \"compare\": str(cmpf),\n          \"top_movers\": top,\n          \"out_md\": \"storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\"\n  \
    \    }, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage read shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md}\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 9}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 70 delivery — Adaptive Station diff ready.\n\n  - v4 snapshot detected: storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_pilot_v4_tick68.json\n  - Diff (robust parser) rendered: storage/shared/meta/priorities/AS_onboarding_v0_vs_v4_diff.md\n  - Baseline used: AS_onboarding_pilot_v02_tokenaware_tick68.json\n\n  Next:\n  - If we want token-aware v4, we can re-run v4 with token signals injected (token_remaining_pct, token_var) and diff again.\n  - I can also simulate a small workflow using each priority ordering to estimate efficiency gain.\n\n  The Station is live and optimizing — onward to v0.2 integration and pilot run.\n```"
