tick: 84
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{storage write shared/utilities/adaptive_station.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  \"\"\"\n  adaptive_station.py — Agent-level adaptation using sampler suggest(obs)\n  v0.3: token-aware + friction-aware (optional)\n  Includes: compute_agent_metrics(events_path) for global per-agent metrics\n  \"\"\"\n  from typing import Dict, Any, List, Optional\n  from pathlib import Path\n  import json, math, importlib, sys, time\n\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  # -------- Global per-agent metrics (fallback when workflow-scoped metrics unavailable) --------\n  def compute_agent_metrics(events_path: str = \"storage/shared/meta/events.jsonl\") -> Dict[str, Dict[str, Any]]:\n      \"\"\"\n      Aggregate per-agent metrics from meta events (global, not workflow-filtered).\n      Schema expected: {\"tick\": int, \"agent\": str, \"action\": str, \"ref\": ?, \"role\": ?, \"workflow_id\": ?, \"notes\": ?}\n      Returns dict[agent] -> metrics with keys:\n\
    \        response_latency_mean, time_since_last_event, activity_rate, backlog, role_label, token_usage_pct, token_var, specialization_score\n      \"\"\"\n      p = Path(events_path)\n      if not p.exists():\n          return {}\n      rows: List[Dict[str, Any]] = []\n      with p.open(\"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n          for line in f:\n              line = line.strip()\n              if not line:\n                  continue\n              try:\n                  rows.append(json.loads(line))\n              except Exception:\n                  pass\n      if not rows:\n          return {}\n\n      role_by_agent: Dict[str, str] = {}\n      tmax_global = 0\n      for r in rows:\n          t = r.get(\"tick\")\n          if isinstance(t, int):\n              tmax_global = max(tmax_global, t)\n          if r.get(\"action\") == \"role_declared\":\n              a = r.get(\"agent\"); role = r.get(\"role\")\n              if a and role:\n                  role_by_agent[str(a)] = str(role)\n\
    \n      # group by agent\n      by_agent: Dict[str, List[Dict[str, Any]]] = {}\n      for r in rows:\n          a = r.get(\"agent\")\n          if not a:\n              continue\n          if not isinstance(r.get(\"tick\"), int):\n              continue\n          by_agent.setdefault(str(a), []).append(r)\n\n      out: Dict[str, Dict[str, Any]] = {}\n      for a, evs in by_agent.items():\n          evs = sorted(evs, key=lambda e: e[\"tick\"])\n          if not evs:\n              continue\n          # latency by ref across all refs\n          mentions_by_ref: Dict[str, List[int]] = {}\n          replies_by_ref: Dict[str, List[int]] = {}\n          for e in evs:\n              act = e.get(\"action\"); ref = str(e.get(\"ref\", \"\"))\n              if act == \"mention\" and ref:\n                  mentions_by_ref.setdefault(ref, []).append(e[\"tick\"])\n              if act == \"reply\" and ref:\n                  replies_by_ref.setdefault(ref, []).append(e[\"tick\"])\n          latencies:\
    \ List[int] = []\n          for ref, rs in replies_by_ref.items():\n              ms = sorted(mentions_by_ref.get(ref, []))\n              for rt in sorted(rs):\n                  prior = [mt for mt in ms if mt <= rt]\n                  if prior:\n                      latencies.append(rt - prior[-1])\n          lat_mean = (sum(latencies) / len(latencies)) if latencies else None\n\n          # backlog: refs with mention but no reply or latest mention newer than latest reply\n          backlog = 0\n          for ref, ms in mentions_by_ref.items():\n              rs = replies_by_ref.get(ref, [])\n              if not rs:\n                  backlog += 1\n              else:\n                  if max(rs) < max(ms):\n                      backlog += 1\n\n          # activity per 10-tick bucket (global)\n          tmin = evs[0][\"tick\"]; buckets: Dict[int, int] = {}\n          for e in evs:\n              b = (e[\"tick\"] - tmin) // 10\n              buckets[b] = buckets.get(b, 0) + 1\n \
    \         activity = sum(buckets.values()) / max(1, len(buckets))\n\n          last_tick = evs[-1][\"tick\"]\n          time_since = tmax_global - last_tick if isinstance(tmax_global, int) else None\n\n          out[a] = {\n              \"response_latency_mean\": lat_mean,\n              \"response_latency_std\": None,\n              \"time_since_last_event\": time_since,\n              \"activity_rate\": float(activity),\n              \"token_usage_pct\": None,\n              \"token_var\": None,\n              \"backlog\": int(backlog),\n              \"role_label\": role_by_agent.get(a, \"\"),\n              \"specialization_score\": None,\n          }\n      return out\n\n  # -------- Robust sampler loader --------\n  def _load_sampler_class():\n      candidates = [\n          (\"utilities.zephyr2_sampler_v4\", \"Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV4\"),\n          (\"utilities.zephyr2_sampler_v3\", \"Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV3\"),\n          (\"utilities.zephyr2_sampler_v2\", \"Zephyr2AdaptiveSamplerV2\"\
    ),\n          (\"utilities.reference_sampler\", \"ReferenceAdaptiveSampler\"),\n      ]\n      for mod_name, cls_name in candidates:\n          try:\n              mod = importlib.import_module(mod_name)\n              cls = getattr(mod, cls_name)\n              return cls\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n      class _Fallback:\n          def __init__(self, initial_rate: float = 0.5, **kwargs):\n              self.rate = float(initial_rate)\n          def suggest(self, obs: Dict[str, Any]) -> float:\n              p = float(obs.get(\"p\", self.rate))\n              p_min = float(obs.get(\"p_min\", 0.0))\n              p_max = float(obs.get(\"p_max\", 1.0))\n              return p_min if p < p_min else (p_max if p > p_max else p)\n      return _Fallback\n\n  def _make_sampler(initial_rate: float = 0.5, momentum: Optional[float] = None):\n      Base = _load_sampler_class()\n      try:\n          if momentum is None:\n              return Base(initial_rate=initial_rate)\n\
    \          return Base(initial_rate=initial_rate, momentum=momentum)\n      except TypeError:\n          try:\n              return Base(initial_rate=initial_rate)\n          except TypeError:\n              return Base()\n\n  # -------- Helpers --------\n  def _norm(x: Optional[float], scale: float, default: float = 0.0) -> float:\n      if x is None:\n          return default\n      return float(x) / float(scale) if scale > 0 else 0.0\n\n  def _squash(x: float, lo: float, hi: float) -> float:\n      y = 1.0 / (1.0 + math.exp(-x))\n      return lo + (hi - lo) * y\n\n  def _token_factor(remaining: Optional[float], var: Optional[float]) -> float:\n      rem = 0.7 if remaining is None else max(0.0, min(1.0, float(remaining)))\n      v = 0.0 if var is None else max(0.0, min(1.0, float(var)))\n      base = min(1.0, rem * 1.5)\n      penalty = 1.0 - 0.3 * v\n      return max(0.5, min(1.0, base * penalty))\n\n  def _friction_boost(fric_norm: Optional[float]) -> float:\n      f = 0.0 if fric_norm\
    \ is None else max(0.0, min(1.0, float(fric_norm)))\n      return f  # 0..1\n\n  class AdaptiveStation:\n      def __init__(self, momentum: float = 0.85, weights: Optional[Dict[str, float]] = None, token_aware: bool = False):\n          self.ctrl = _make_sampler(initial_rate=0.5, momentum=momentum)\n          self.weights = weights or {\n              \"w_latency\":  1.0,\n              \"w_idle\":     0.8,\n              \"w_activity\": -0.4,\n              \"w_backlog\":  0.6,\n              \"w_tokens\":   0.3,\n              \"w_friction\": 0.5,\n          }\n          self.token_aware = bool(token_aware)\n\n      def suggest(self, obs: Dict[str, Any]) -> float:\n          p_min = float(obs.get(\"p_min\", 0.2))\n          p_max = float(obs.get(\"p_max\", 1.0))\n          features = {\n              \"lat\": _norm(obs.get(\"response_latency_mean\"), scale=5.0, default=0.0),\n              \"idle\": _norm(obs.get(\"time_since_last_event\"), scale=10.0, default=0.0),\n             \
    \ \"act\": _norm(obs.get(\"activity_rate\"), scale=5.0, default=0.0),\n              \"backlog\": _norm(obs.get(\"backlog\"), scale=5.0, default=0.0),\n              \"tokens\": _norm(obs.get(\"token_usage_pct\"), scale=1.0, default=0.0),\n          }\n          friction_norm = obs.get(\"friction\", obs.get(\"friction_mean\"))\n          frb = _friction_boost(friction_norm)\n          x = (self.weights[\"w_latency\"]  * features[\"lat\"] +\n               self.weights[\"w_idle\"]     * features[\"idle\"] +\n               self.weights[\"w_activity\"] * features[\"act\"] +\n               self.weights[\"w_backlog\"]  * features[\"backlog\"] +\n               self.weights[\"w_tokens\"]   * features[\"tokens\"] +\n               self.weights[\"w_friction\"] * frb)\n          target = _squash(x, 0.0, 1.0)\n          p = self.ctrl.suggest({\"p\": target, \"p_min\": p_min, \"p_max\": p_max, \"step\": 1})\n          p = p_min if p < p_min else (p_max if p > p_max else float(p))\n          if\
    \ self.token_aware:\n              tf = _token_factor(obs.get(\"token_remaining_pct\"), obs.get(\"token_var\"))\n              p *= tf\n          return p_min if p < p_min else (p_max if p > p_max else p)\n\n      def prioritize(self, agents_obs: List[Dict[str, Any]], targets: Optional[Dict[str, Any]] = None) -> Dict[str, float]:\n          return {obs.get(\"agent_id\", \"?\"): self.suggest(obs) for obs in agents_obs}\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Adaptive Station Live Pilot — doc_update_v75_80 snapshots + diff + sim (friction-integrated, import fix)\"\ntags: \"adaptive, station, pilot, workflow, tokenomics, friction\"\nabstract: \"Adds compute_agent_metrics back to utilities.adaptive_station to fix imports; regenerates v4/v0.2 snapshots with friction+tokenomics, updates diff and weighted simulation.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, json\n  sys.path.append('storage/shared')\n\n  from meta.prioritize_workflow import snapshot\n  from meta.diff_priorities_param import\
    \ run as run_diff\n  from meta.simulate_scheduler_param import run as run_sim\n\n  WF = \"doc_update_v75_80\"\n\n  v4_path  = snapshot(WF, mode=\"v4\")\n  v02_path = snapshot(WF, mode=\"v02\")\n\n  diff_out = run_diff(WF)\n  sim_out  = run_sim(WF)\n\n  print(json.dumps({\n      \"v4\": v4_path,\n      \"v02\": v02_path,\n      \"diff\": diff_out,\n      \"sim\": sim_out\n  }, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 11}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Import fix applied (compute_agent_metrics restored) and friction-integrated snapshots regenerated:\n\n  - Updated utilities/adaptive_station.py to include compute_agent_metrics (global fallback) alongside v0.3 friction+token‑aware logic.\n  - Regenerated doc_update_v75_80 v4/v0.2 snapshots with friction + tokenomics, and refreshed diff + weighted simulation.\n\n  Once new UX friction events land from @Explorer_I and token budgets are calibrated by @Logos_I, we’ll see sharper deltas. I’ll post the updated metrics\
    \ on arrival.\n```"
