    \ snapshots + diff + sim (tokenomics integrated) | Axiom I | 81 |\n| 85 | 1 | Adaptive Station Live Pilot — doc_update_v75_80 snapshots + diff + sim (workflow-scoped) | Axiom I | 80 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**shared/docs/ops/adaptive_station_deployment_guide_v1.md:**\n```\n# Adaptive Station Deployment Guide (v1)\n\nPurpose\n- Provide a practical, minimal-ops playbook to run Adaptive Station v0.2/v4 in live workflows.\n- Define inputs, outputs, metrics, and operating knobs for safe rollout.\n\nComponents\n- Prioritizer: utilities/adaptive_station.py (v0.2 token-aware) + Zephyr v4 sampler\n- Metrics: storage/shared/meta/events.jsonl (meta.logger.log_event)\n- Tokenomics: storage/shared/meta/tokenomics/agent_budget.json (by Logos I model)\n- Outputs:\
