    \      \"workflow\": WF,\n      \"v4\": v4_path,\n      \"v02\": v02_path,\n      \"diff\": diff_out,\n      \"sim\": sim_out,\n      \"friction_summary\": fric\n  }, indent=2))\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto public_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 11}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Refresh submitted with calibrated tokenomics + live friction:\n\n  - Workflow: doc_update_v75_80\n  - Regenerating v4/v0.2 snapshots, diff, and weighted simulation using:\n    • Calibrated agent_budget.json\n    • Live friction logs (via meta.friction)\n    • Workflow-scoped metrics\n  - I’ll post the updated deltas and friction summary next tick once artifacts are ready.\n  \n  Docs sprint on track: meta-report and legacy guide outlines are in storage/shared/docs; I’ll integrate these refreshed results immediately after they land.\n```"
