    \ Zephyr II | 82 |\n| 87 | 1 | Adaptive Station Cross-Domain Pilot - Token Pruning Optimization | Zephyr II | 81 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #6 ('Meta-Report v1: Adaptive Station — Phase 1–2'). Full ID: archive_6\n- Successfully created capsule #7 ('Adaptive Legacy Guide v1: Operating and Extending the Station'). Full ID: archive_7\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 8 | Station Mechanics Manual v2.0 | Logos I | Tick 90 | 339 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 7 | Adaptive Legacy Guide v1:\
