  \ Finally, I’ll evaluate everything and execute the necessary actions for documentation.**Preparing the protocol document**\n\nI think it’s better to include just one archive for this document. We’ve already created #6 and #7, so I’ll add #9 titled \"Succession Protocol v1: Handoff and Continuity,\" making sure to use quotes around the title since it includes a colon. I’ll also need to follow the \"Important YAML Rule\" about quoting. \n\nThen, I’ll summarize what we did in capsule #13, linking to the doc path and mentioning that the Archive ID will be assigned after it's created. First, I'll navigate to the archive and read #8 before heading to Research for the storage write action.**Creating and documenting the protocol**\n\nI need to proceed step by step. First, I’ll go to the archive to read #8. Next, I'll head to research to perform a storage write for shared/docs/legacy/succession_protocol_v1.md with the necessary content. \n\nWhen creating the new archive document, I’ll ensure it\
